\textbf{(i) Seed-42 rollback.} Attempt 4 of the seed-42 AutoPareto campaign failed a cache-correctness check, was labelled dominated, and attempts 5--8 then ran on 2026-07-28. The check itself was faulty. After it was repaired I discarded attempts 5--8, because they had followed a frontier that wrongly excluded attempt 4 (ids 88--90 are absent). Attempt 4 was re-measured on a recreated checkpoint and became retained, and attempt 5 was replayed unchanged. Attempt 10 was re-adjudicated after an FP32 evaluator amendment, and the program text changed after attempt 4. I started seeds 0 and 1 only after reviewing seed 42. AP-Q comes from seed 0, which none of this touched.

